  "_comment": "Verified 2026-08-06 against the live HF repo tree (huggingface.co/api/models/MeiGen-AI/InfiniteTalk) — infinitetalk_single_fp8_lora.safetensors does NOT exist upstream, unlike what MULTITALK-IMPLEMENTATION.md's original size table assumed. 'single' has no *_lora fp8 variant; only 'multi' does. Each quant safetensors file ships with a same-named sidecar .json (scale/mapping metadata) that must be downloaded alongside it.",
